# MixAuto map engine (`MapLibreEngineImpl` + `CarMapEngine`)

## Agent front matter

**High-speed puck/camera hitch triage (classify before editing):**

| Likely cause | Check first | Owner files |
|--------------|-------------|-------------|
| Smoothing lag (rubber-banding / bounce catch-up) | `SmoothingLocationEngine` blend/extrapolation, `resolveBlendStart`, `shouldSmoothPuckMotion()` | `SmoothingLocationEngine.kt`, `LocationTrackingController.kt` |
| Camera churn | `NavigationCameraController` tracking modes, `cameraSessionId`, padding while `TRACKING_GPS` | `NavigationCameraController.kt` |
| Driving / nav tilt | `NAV_TILT_OFFSET` on facade companion (live); `navTilt()` applies; `driving_tilt` pref = free-drive only; MapLibre **0° = overhead**, higher = more pitched | `MapLibreEngineImpl` companion + `setDrivingTilt`, `NavigationCameraController.navTilt()`, `LauncherPreferences` |
| Tile/render hitch | `DrivingTilePrefetcher`, vector style load, RenderThread work at speed | `MapStyleController.kt`, `DrivingTilePrefetcher.kt` |
| Main-thread work | `applyAndroidLocation`, GeoJSON rebuild, UI state throttle | `LocationTrackingController.kt`, `RouteRenderer.kt` (route line only) |

**Label artifact triage (stretched / streaked / smeared text under tilted nav):**

| Likely cause | Check first | Owner files |
|--------------|-------------|-------------|
| Style text under nav tilt | `text-pitch-alignment` missing on road/place labels; nav tilt = free-drive + `NAV_TILT_OFFSET` (default +15°) | style / `MapStyleController`, bundled `mix-auto-driving.json` |
| MapLibre #2788 streaks | icon+text on one `SymbolLayer` under tilt | `PoiOverlayRenderer` (`poiIconOnly*` / `poiTextOnly*`), Liberty `poi_r*` hide path |
| Labels wrongly visible in nav | mix labels gated by `shouldShowMixPoiLabels()`; native POI hide must stay sticky | `PoiOverlayCoordinator`, `PoiOverlayRenderer.syncNativePoiLayerVisibility` |

**Nav-mode label stretch:** `shouldShowMixPoiLabels()` is false while `isNavigating` — mix `poiTextOnly*` (VIEWPORT) does not render during nav. Fix style symbol `text-pitch-alignment` in `mix-auto-driving.json` / `MapStyleController`, not a VIEWPORT→MAP flip on mix labels. Use **`.\scripts\run-tool.ps1`** (`check_driving_text_pitch` / `fix_driving_text_pitch`); never `python -c`; do not treat as binary, leave `*.backup`, or `indent=2` dump.

**Style text pitch (nav stretch) — golden:**

```python
# DO — pitch lives under layout (MapLibre style spec)
layout = layer.setdefault("layout", {})
if layer.get("type") == "symbol" and "text-field" in layout:
    layout["text-pitch-alignment"] = "viewport"
layer.pop("text-pitch-alignment", None)  # root key is ignored / no-op

# Prefer run-tool (Windows):
# powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\run-tool.ps1 fix_driving_text_pitch
# DON'T — python -c one-liners on PowerShell; layer["text-pitch-alignment"] at root
# DON'T — json.dump(..., indent=2) on this asset
# DON'T — MAP; don't flip mix poiTextOnly VIEWPORT→MAP
```

**Do not as first move:** raise `DRIVING_ANIMATION_FPS` or tighten `LOCATION_ENGINE_*`; mass-retune `SmoothingLocationEngine` companion constants (including `blendDurationForSpeed`); **raise** `EXTRAPOLATION_MAX_MS` / `EXTRAPOLATION_MAX_M` / snap-back for rubber-band (ahead-then-snap); change mix text pitch from VIEWPORT to MAP; use `RouteRenderer` for puck glide (route greying ≠ puck motion); touch Compose text / `MapHostViewModel` for map label stretch; bump `NAV_TILT_OFFSET` when the user wants overhead / flatter look-ahead; full-dump `MapLibreEngineImpl` for tilt apply (grep `navTilt` / `NAV_TILT_OFFSET` first); call `local-apk` until diagnosis + `assembleDebug` succeed.

**Facade rule:** new logic in `data/map/` collaborators — do not grow `MapLibreEngineImpl`. Grep all hits before changing constants; prefer controllers when duplicated. Exception: `NAV_TILT_OFFSET` on the facade companion is live (not stale).

